From 2a934287a4c684df5ed38647712fc479465f3d90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zerkiller <84400002+florinp93@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 18:42:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add native Vulkan renderer with D3D12-GPU interop

- Implement NativeDevice using DiligentCore Vulkan backend with
  swapchain, blit pipeline, and texture upload
- Implement NativePresenter with aspect-fit letterboxing, correct
  viewport/scissor geometry, and resize/minimize handling
- Add D3D12-to-Vulkan GPU interop: shared texture export via
  ID3D12Device1::CreateSharedHandle, external memory import via
  VK_KHR_external_memory_win32, adapter LUID verification, and
  Flush+WaitForIdle synchronization for tear-free presentation
- Fix color channel mapping (A2R10G10B10 format + BGR swizzle)
- Preserve CPU readback as automatic fallback when interop is
  unavailable or fails at runtime
- Add native_renderer_test with 64 aspect/scaling regression cases
- Integrate native renderer into app with use_native_presenter and
  use_gpu_interop cvars
